cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or framework, please cite the associated article and this repository."
title: "Data-Limited National WWTP Greenhouse-Gas Inventory Framework"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Zheng"
    given-names: "Hongting"
license: "MIT"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of a hierarchical bottom-up framework for constructing
  national greenhouse-gas inventories of municipal wastewater treatment plants
  under data-limited conditions. The workflow combines local plant-level model
  fitting, national extrapolation, Monte Carlo uncertainty propagation, and
  Sobol-like sensitivity diagnostics.
keywords:
  - wastewater treatment plants
  - greenhouse-gas inventory
  - hierarchical modelling
  - data-limited assessment
  - Monte Carlo simulation
  - sensitivity analysis
